title: "n2o-hybrid-injector-sizing"
abstract: >-
  Physics-based tool and technical reference for predicting premature
  vaporisation (flashing) of N2O in the feed systems of hybrid rocket motors
  and for sizing injector orifices that account for two-phase flow effects.
type: software
authors:
